From 0c57bc7d528b03d3c9d3d642bf4c08a6c1f66ecc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 02:18:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Hotkeys read from the shared config.ini; five controller
 hotkeys; ui_scale gone

The launcher writes [KeyMap] to shared_config_dir()/config.ini (the
install root on a multi-disc install) while the runtime read the exe-dir
copy first, so every hotkey edit on a multi-disc install was dead - the
Switch disc key included. The shared file is read first now.
Controller hotkeys beyond rewind / save states: Switch disc, F1 menu,
Fullscreen, Fast-forward (hold), FPS readout - [hotkeys] switch_disc_pad
etc., same encoding as rewind_pad, unbound by default; the Switch disc
label is blanked on single-disc installs. The launcher ui_scale setting
is removed (the launcher scales from the desktop height instead).
